{"root":{"data":{"id":"dmcnbvx4ms00","created":1792802172127,"text":"呼吸功能不全\nrespiratory insufficiency"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmcnd623xxk0","created":1792802272561,"text":"1.概念"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmcne0nu0wg0","created":1792802339178,"text":"（1）呼吸功能不全"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmcne7zlirc0","created":1792802355126,"text":"在影响外呼吸功能的疾病发展过程中，当呼吸负荷加重时\nPaO2⬇或伴有PaCO2⬆，并出现相应的体征和症状","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmcnfnjfcu80","created":1792802467342,"text":"（2）呼吸衰竭"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmcnft1bpcw0","created":1792802479308,"text":"机体在海平面静息时吸入空气的条件下，\n由于外呼吸功能严重障碍导致PaO2＜60mmHg，\n或伴有PaCO2＞50mmHg，"},"children":[]}]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}